# ex31 — spatial top-k fixture at 8x8 (mirrors demos/4-order/044-spatial-topk.bqn)
# 64 cell-entities, row id = flat index k; the '@ 8 8' frame synthesizes x = k mod 8, y = k div 8 per cell, so no coordinate columns sit at rest (a spawn would extend them with false zeros)
# safety = 100 - ((x-2)^2 + (y-3)^2), peaks 100 at the keep (2,3) = cell 26; resource = x*y, max 49 at cell 63
# sentry marks spawn-appended Sentry rows (the .bqn's per-cell count becomes rows parented to their cell)
